      "prompt": "Conditional probability $P(A\\mid B)$ equals:\nA) $P(A)+P(B)$\nB) $\\frac{P(A\\cap B)}{P(B)}$\nC) $P(A)\\cdot P(B)$\nD) $\\frac{P(B)}{P(A)}$",
